    "# Closing\n",
    "This concludes the assignment on attempting the automatically repair violations to functional dependencies.\n",
    "\n",
    "For those of you who'd like to dig a little bit deeper, please find below two optional additional exercises. I'd be happy to check and give feedback on your solutions to these exercises.\n",
    "\n",
